{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","id":"pg_0fcc20ddd92c59a291246d7555a0423e","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/fullive-ai-anima-readme-zh-cn-md-ea1542ff8420-6d7555a0423e.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_3d6dae0b021f59d6930c31a9362464b4"],"title":"Fullive-AI/Anima/README.zh-CN.md @ ea1542ff8420","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_06c1ddab72c98cb7ae04d2a0a4338c012c93c39dd4bb96b75e90300769f9c015"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Built-in skills include light, humidifier, air_conditioner, air_purifier, speaker, coordinator, device_discovery, and skill_creator; custom skills can be added under skills/custom/."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0bfbc75d615a2cecf48f59390929509be33027166156568dcfb249a83a42a76e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Anima is described as an open-source Agent OS for intelligent hardware, aiming to give home devices perceptive, decision-making, learning, and extensible AI capabilities rather than being a device control panel."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2af37671bd9d163d8a0142d3b9265e01aa97d55f4257982f064e9826f6831d29"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Extracted memories use a schema with claim_type categories (explicit/implicit preferences, routines, aliases, constraints, home context), positive/negative evidence, and status values candidate/confirmed/rejected/stale; only confirmed memory enters skill decisions by default."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3925c94946030187bae7ab5c4896b19dd9292b98494c8f077ef30b82c49e9296"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime chain is device discovery, sensor/event updates, a rules fast path for safety, an LLM slow path, command execution via adapters, memory/history writes, and dashboard visibility."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3a845cbbe42e0dbab1b9910a112b73e90d5b4b8825b52114fe6bae39db771b91"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Brain is designed to decide within explicit skill boundaries, device capabilities, and safety rules rather than letting an LLM control devices freely."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3cc0c015e1d3d540c24426639c96a0e46790fe4e6630f6827b1389e96558072e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The backend exposes REST endpoints including /health, /api/devices, /api/chat, /api/environment, /api/scan, /api/memory, /api/settings, and Xiaomi QR login start/poll endpoints, with Swagger at localhost:8080/docs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4dd9ff3566948e4f7a033d05a2775970da5d48c66c8305cf750c4a48e8faa60a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"LLM integration is OpenAI-compatible, configured via ANIMA_LLM_API_KEY and optionally ANIMA_LLM_BASE_URL, supporting OpenAI, DeepSeek, Doubao, proxied Anthropic, and Ollama-compatible endpoints."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9b51c7b503d41e58c67777bcd68227a0a910dc0444c3b5a01c2658667ccae212"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The stack is Python 3.11-3.13 with FastAPI and LangGraph plus a React dashboard; Docker Compose is the recommended deployment, requiring only Docker Desktop or Docker Engine with the Compose plugin."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9f7cebc7de082417d4e66dbf9851a0ded38ceeb64b50e8d3bc6fe47c09d7a1a9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime comprises a Brain decision layer, device Skills, a layered Memory system, hardware Adapters, a FastAPI backend, and a React dashboard; core/main.py is the composition root and startup entrypoint."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c2a37ddc35ea3edae99c44735ac7b4ff4032d906d0b0f84365cbbbe71ca98a16"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills are device domain-knowledge packages with a defined layout: SKILL.md metadata, references (knowledge, decide, learn prompts), and scripts/actions.py as the structured action execution entrypoint."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cc9846b5244a7ee7f2c545ee5cbd6d77e0a722dc20dc5273b0368db3654620a8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Memory is layered: L1 core identity loaded on every request, L2 a memory directory for the planner, and L3 detailed memories retrieved by device type and task before skill execution."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dcb6f79a76322ed93536504e7876c5d0492ef4b4c1679d92c37873c4674aca7d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"MIoT command execution depends on each device's reachable local IP and token; Xiaomi Cloud login is mainly for discovery and token acquisition, not universal cloud remote control."}],"claim_ids":["clm_06c1ddab72c98cb7ae04d2a0a4338c012c93c39dd4bb96b75e90300769f9c015","clm_0bfbc75d615a2cecf48f59390929509be33027166156568dcfb249a83a42a76e","clm_2af37671bd9d163d8a0142d3b9265e01aa97d55f4257982f064e9826f6831d29","clm_3925c94946030187bae7ab5c4896b19dd9292b98494c8f077ef30b82c49e9296","clm_3a845cbbe42e0dbab1b9910a112b73e90d5b4b8825b52114fe6bae39db771b91","clm_3cc0c015e1d3d540c24426639c96a0e46790fe4e6630f6827b1389e96558072e","clm_4dd9ff3566948e4f7a033d05a2775970da5d48c66c8305cf750c4a48e8faa60a","clm_9b51c7b503d41e58c67777bcd68227a0a910dc0444c3b5a01c2658667ccae212","clm_9f7cebc7de082417d4e66dbf9851a0ded38ceeb64b50e8d3bc6fe47c09d7a1a9","clm_c2a37ddc35ea3edae99c44735ac7b4ff4032d906d0b0f84365cbbbe71ca98a16","clm_cc9846b5244a7ee7f2c545ee5cbd6d77e0a722dc20dc5273b0368db3654620a8","clm_dcb6f79a76322ed93536504e7876c5d0492ef4b4c1679d92c37873c4674aca7d"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","id":"pg_204f072d322b5fb0a4d627ae87b72a43","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/fullive-ai-anima-readme-md-ea1542ff8420-27ae87b72a43.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6b0f225720f35491b2bcfe2b16b66859"],"title":"Fullive-AI/Anima/README.md @ ea1542ff8420","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","id":"pg_236c16dca6315aaeb773298a629c5505","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/fullive-ai-anima-docs-plans-design-md-ea1542ff8420-298a629c5505.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_69c1e0df49295058ab655d5fd8562d6d"],"title":"Fullive-AI/Anima/docs/plans/design.md @ ea1542ff8420","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_247e5c7fedb850fedcfd3756826acdf3774a04afad92b0cd48c6470bd61e3a78"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: AGENT.md and ARCHITECTURE_GUARDRAILS.md target coding agents contributing to the repo, defining module ownership boundaries, change heuristics, and testing expectations such as running tests under tests/ before considering work complete."},{"claim_ids":["clm_78b9daea3331e0375dc183432c508859db32ba23556679864b75aa73a34b9cfd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per AGENT.md, MQTT is not the main production event path, the dashboard is polling-based rather than realtime, room modeling is weak, and chat is narrow task routing rather than a full assistant."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9f7cebc7de082417d4e66dbf9851a0ded38ceeb64b50e8d3bc6fe47c09d7a1a9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime comprises a Brain decision layer, device Skills, a layered Memory system, hardware Adapters, a FastAPI backend, and a React dashboard; core/main.py is the composition root and startup entrypoint."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e0d994ab5624ad8f9917691c96dba6bb59b93eb5e075f052efd887ed929297db"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per AGENT.md, the implemented system is a single-process Python backend under core/ with file-based memory in data/memory and a polling-based frontend refresh."}],"claim_ids":["clm_247e5c7fedb850fedcfd3756826acdf3774a04afad92b0cd48c6470bd61e3a78","clm_78b9daea3331e0375dc183432c508859db32ba23556679864b75aa73a34b9cfd","clm_9f7cebc7de082417d4e66dbf9851a0ded38ceeb64b50e8d3bc6fe47c09d7a1a9","clm_e0d994ab5624ad8f9917691c96dba6bb59b93eb5e075f052efd887ed929297db"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_53ae1b6cb36c447db113d6dc1d68299a","id":"pg_3ed8abf924d6571392bac84f714a71c4","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/fullive-ai-anima-agent-md-ea1542ff8420-c84f714a71c4.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0",